:22374644,"user_id":8566199,"title":"WeIND UP – Game Environment Project (Team Project)","description":"<p>WeIND UP is a team-based cooperative puzzle game environment project currently in development.</p>\n\n<p>I translated 2D environment concept art into a fully realized 3D world in Unreal Engine, focusing on establishing mood, spatial composition, and visual coherence.\n<br />My work involved building the environment through mesh placement, prop creation, and lighting, ensuring atmospheric consistency and clear gameplay readability for cooperative puzzle interaction.</p>\n\n<p>Level design was handled by a dedicated level designer, and my responsibility was to execute and enhance the environment within the established layout through visual and atmospheric direction.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/Studio_Gravitia?s=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://x.com/Studio_Gravitia?s=20</a></p>","description_html":"<p>WeIND UP is a team-based cooperative puzzle game environment project currently in development.\n<br />I translated 2D environment concept art into a fully realized 3D world in Unreal Engine, focusing on establishing mood, spatial composition, and visual coherence.\n<br />My work involved building the environment through mesh placement, prop creation, and lighting, ensuring atmospheric consistency and clear gameplay readability for cooperative puzzle interaction.\n<br />Level design was handled by a dedicated level designer, and my responsibility was to execute and enhance the environment within the established layout through visual and atmospheric direction.\n<br /><a href=\"https://x.com/Studio_Gravitia?s=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://x.com/Studio_Gravitia?s=20</a></p>","created_at":"2026-05-21T21:46:06.759-05:00","updated_at":"2026-08-07T12:25:08.823-05:00","views_count":57,"likes_count":5,"comments_count":0,"permalink":"https://www.artstation.com/artwork/rlxNzG","cover_url":"https://cdna.artstation.com/p/assets/covers/images/099/265/642/medium/minjeong-kim-minjeong-kim-somenail-up.webp?1779417962","published_at":"2026-05-21T21:46:35.784-05:00","editor_pick":false,"adult_content":false,"admin_adult_content":false,"slug":"weind-up-game-environment-project-team-project-1","suppressed":false,"hash_id":"rlxNzG","visible":true,"is_promotional":false}